---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Colophon" current="colophon">
	<h1>Colophon</h1>
	<p class="notebook-meta">How this notebook is kept.</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Essays and catalog data live as markdown in a public git repository.</li>
		<li>Design tokens and layout are described in <code>DESIGN.md</code> in the public repository. The notebook look is inspired by <a href="https://michellelinmd.com/">michellelinmd.com</a>.</li>
		<li>Pages are pre-rendered with Astro; contact and subscribe run on a Cloudflare Worker.</li>
		<li>ORCID and GitHub remain canonical publication and code records.</li>
		<li>Interactive tools with their own release cycle deploy on subdomains and are linked from project pages.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		Authoring conventions: <code>~~strikethrough~~</code>, <code>++handwritten++</code> in the line, and{" "}
		<code>{"^((note))"}</code> (or <code>{"^((#id))"}</code> plus <code>Margin[id]:</code>) for a gutter note with an arrow
		from that caret. See <code>DESIGN.md</code>.
	</p>
</BaseLayout>